  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Ukraine Climate Promise II: Advancing Green Finance and Inclusive NDC Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Initiation Plan is part of UNDPs global Climate Promise initiative, aimed at assisting Ukraine in advancing its enhanced Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs) under the Paris Agreement. The project focuses on supporting Ukraine&#x2019;s climate goals by fostering inclusive, gender-responsive governance, integrating green finance mechanisms, and developing strategies for the effective delivery and tracking of climate commitments. This effort is crucial in supporting Ukraine&#x2019;s transition to a low-carbon, climate-resilient economy. The project, initiated in response to Ukraines request through the NDC Partnership, aims to strengthen policy frameworks, regulatory provisions, and institutional capacities to accelerate the implementation of Ukraine&#x2019;s NDCs. The focus areas include renewable energy development, sustainable environmental practices, and the establishment of a low-carbon economy.</narrative>
  </description>
